#: scenario9:scenario9_9F61379E_0202_45A8_9850_9E023C02FA8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9284d0b8572797bf02c37356fa2e3b9ad1935ef63282a3decb82861d70ed99d2
